cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Polymerase and primer biases in eukaryote ultra-long-read metabarcoding
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite both the article from
  preferred-citation and the software itself.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Leho
    family-names: Tedersoo
